{
  "$schema": "../gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json",
  "identifier": "default",
  "description": "Main window: session commands, reloading profiles and opening the profile file, taskbar flash and badge, program updates as sessions, workspace and scrollback, notes (private and shared project notes, including turning shared notes on and unlocking them), folder dialog, clipboard text, pasting a clipboard image as a saved file, opening the detached side panel window (fixed label and URL, remembered size and place), desktop notifications, git branches and changes, the commit history (one page of commits and the changes of one commit), the file tree of a session's folder (listing one folder at a time, never leaving it) and opening one of its files in a read-only viewer window (fresh label, fixed URL and size), worktrees, local claims (overlaps between the user's own sessions), the agent gate (answering an agent's held edit), profile editing and keychain secrets, session export, notification area icon and showing the window, read-only sub-agent view, the context meter of the sessions, the Hangar account (sign-in, projects, opening its own pages), the team connection (sharing a project, confirming new devices, linking repositories, the sessions' states for the team's presence, reserving tasks and answering release requests), updates and restart",
  "windows": ["main"],
